  "goodToKnow": "Zierlich means dainty, petite or delicate: eine zierliche Gestalt, zierliche Handschrift, ein zierlicher Stuhl. It's a compliment for slender, small and graceful people or objects. Related: die Zierde (ornament), zieren (to adorn), and sich zieren (to be coy, play hard to get). Synonyms: grazil, fein, filigran. The opposite is kräftig or plump."
